<div class="spec"><div class="wrap"><span class="id">ELEMENT 13 · MOTION LAB</span><span class="use">five motion languages on the same homepage elements · pick ONE, it becomes the sitewide grammar · switcher + replay below · lives on the Kit only</span></div></div>
<section class="mlab" id="mlab" data-motion="settle">
  <div class="mlab-bar">
    <div class="wrap mlab-bar-in">
      <span class="mono mlab-k">\ Motion lab</span>
      <div class="mlab-btns" role="tablist" aria-label="Motion language">
